 R←Test_SendEmail_01(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text
⍝ Send the most simple email and check the SMTP dialogue
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'MAIL FROM: <tester@aplteam.test>')∊∆SERVER.Commands
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'RCPT TO: <john.doe@example.com>')∊∆SERVER.Commands
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'LOGIN' 'tester@aplteam.test' 'secret')∊∆SERVER.Logons
 →T.PassesIf parms.Subject≡text ∆Header'Subject'
 →T.PassesIf'<john.doe@example.com>'≡text ∆Header'To'
 →T.PassesIf'<tester@aplteam.test>'≡text ∆Header'From'
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'Test mail')∊SMTP.Message.SplitLines text

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
